
MsgBase Convert - (AmiExpress -> LogicBBS)

Reqtools.Library Required!

Selected Directories must be the conference directory (ie. BBS:PUBLIC)
 and not any sub-directory! Any non Amix Conference directory selected
 will be ignored!

Ie.
BBS:Elite/MsgBase/HeaderFile
BBS:Elite/MsgBase/MailStats
or
BBS:Request/MsgBase/HeaderFile
BBS:Request/MsgBase/MailStats

In this example I would have had to select "BBS:"

Only one conference at a time. Output is "Ram:MsgBase.Idx"
Copy the letter data files and the "Msgbase.idx" yourself, to the
{BBSMAINPATH}CONFS/{CONFERENCE}/ directory.

